sanctioned: this program reads one SQLite file through Ipe.Db.Store over both an app connection (Db.open) and an external read-only connection (Ipe.Db.Dsn.open). Ipe.Db.Store and external Dsn connections are Ipê-only additions with no counterpart in the reference backend, and Ipê emits Rust+sqlx while the reference emits a different backend, so a shared Main.ipe cannot run on both. Ipê's output is recorded as the correct reference. The output lines assert, in order: (1) the external allOn / findWhereOn / getOn decode a SQL NULL reason as Nothing, never Just ""; (2) an external read through a plain String field refuses the NULL row with a typed error; (3) joinToList / joinToMaybe read the NULL cell as Nothing on both sides, and a plain String side refuses with a typed error; (4) a raw Db.findWhere maps the NULL column to Just Nothing; (5) a raw-column store's readText on the NULL cell is a typed error naming the column; (6) a String select projection of the NULL cell is a typed error; (7) the stored REALs 1234567.5, 3.0 and -0.0 read as the same text on all, allOn, joinToList, select and a raw findWhere; (8) a non-finite REAL is a typed error on allOn, the join and a raw findWhere.
